Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: python, python-tokenizers
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: Hugging Face Tokenizers for Termux - text to tokens
 Installs the prebuilt python-tokenizers from the Termux User
 Repository (tur-repo, added by this repo's install.sh), so no Rust
 compile. Command: tokenizers-check.
